  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Resilience to Floods in the Polog Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s goal is to instigate transformational change in managing flood risk in the region, and proactively respond to floods in an integrated manner to manage hazards, and exposure of communities to prevent losses and impact of future floods.</narrative>
  </description>
